+# TLS Certificate Verification
+
+The project's current recorded decision is that TLS certificate verification must be enabled on all builds, including development builds: an earlier workaround that disabled certificate verification for development builds was explicitly called out and retired in favor of requiring verification everywhere, and no subsequent decision has reinstated any development-build exception.
